  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DANIDA Strategic Partnership 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam will identify local community organizations that are active in the targeted governorates on gender equality A TOTs will be conducted by a core team of trainers selected among renowned local trainers in Syria with knowledge of the targeted governorates, as well as  experience in gender equality and gender leadership in humanitarian action. Participated organization will be coached on preparing  gender leadership initiatives fit the gender leadership trainings &apos;objectives. A series of joint reflection and learning event for targeted organizations will be organised as the concluding step of the sub -granting activity.</narrative>
  </description>
